                                        "entry_id": "569f160d-da47-38b1-bc4a-f654cca863f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plumpness, stoutness, especially when voluptuous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a596493-c5d9-463d-9453-cdcdf25c3c5d",
                                                "sense_id": "e75e8132-6e80-37db-8530-c2c9afcdf8b1",
                                                "text": "She was slightly inclined to embonpoint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93e6d1e9-8afb-4581-b725-4e68cfb9ce46",
                                                "sense_id": "e75e8132-6e80-37db-8530-c2c9afcdf8b1",
                                                "text": "The beautiful woman threw off her sabletrimmed wrap, displaying her queenly shoulders and heaving embonpoint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "529b2fe0-b94e-4e8f-bcba-702e75f05cc1",
                                                "sense_id": "e75e8132-6e80-37db-8530-c2c9afcdf8b1",
                                                "text": "The patient's physicians had always allowed him to indulge a gargantuan appetite, countering his intake and regulating his embonpoint by a heroic diet of purges and enemas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "embonpoint",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "115ba10c-6741-30c9-9b40-4f90af51c93e",
                                        "entry_id": "62ef90dd-f3fd-38b7-8948-5945e309d426",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plump, chubby, buxom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e27937c1-5cd7-4ec2-916e-af38d683b62c",
                                                "sense_id": "115ba10c-6741-30c9-9b40-4f90af51c93e",
                                                "text": "\"Though it is six years since I have seen you,\" exclaimed Anne, \"you are not the least altered; instead of that, you are handsomer than ever; your being rather more embonpoint suits you, and your complexion is brilliant to a degree.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "04cb6ac3-6108-4fa4-9181-87419e27f794",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b47c480-7c12-3dcf-99f2-f6e4e8ae2c84",
                        "source_sense_id": "f76cb9bd-24a7-3187-9aba-9d740e9de556",
                        "target_lang_word": "plumpness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plumpness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2042694a-a885-3c1a-bfd6-4a661e2288e1",
                                        "entry_id": "afe62d06-e337-3731-8731-cc6462441db1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being plump."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1afefcc3-175e-4a26-b966-ad0d75ad848d",
                                                "sense_id": "2042694a-a885-3c1a-bfd6-4a661e2288e1",
                                                "text": "From behind that structure came out an impression of pale plumpness in a frock-coat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed7dbbaa-5cb8-4443-9319-b39456cc23ba",
                                                "sense_id": "2042694a-a885-3c1a-bfd6-4a661e2288e1",
                                                "text": "For five minutes Pollyanna worked swiftly, deftly, combing a refractory curl into fluffiness, perking up a drooping ruffle at the neck, or shaking a pillow into plumpness so that the head might have a better pose. Meanwhile the sick woman, frowning prodigiously, and openly scoffing at the whole procedure, was, in spite of herself, beginning to tingle with a feeling perilously near to excitement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fac24ca5-81c7-4451-beea-7925511a6222",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b47c480-7c12-3dcf-99f2-f6e4e8ae2c84",
                        "source_sense_id": "f76cb9bd-24a7-3187-9aba-9d740e9de556",
                        "target_lang_word": "corpulence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "corpulence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de319926-6b64-304d-993c-3a41d2ba0c77",
                                        "entry_id": "f00f9689-2cdb-3781-90e4-405259f4eada",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristic or state of being corpulent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b26e1cc0-77d9-486d-9caf-a6a858fa5b4e",
                                                "sense_id": "de319926-6b64-304d-993c-3a41d2ba0c77",
                                                "text": "Corpulence is a beauty: girls are fattened to a vast bulk by drenches of curds and cream thickened with flour, and are duly disciplined when they refuse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dd3448cf-b0ef-4c46-a929-eedd0979df17",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b47c480-7c12-3dcf-99f2-f6e4e8ae2c84",
                        "source_sense_id": "f76cb9bd-24a7-3187-9aba-9d740e9de556",
                        "target_lang_word": "overweight",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "overweight",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd59d8ef-76fb-37ab-8e10-c6f5257f5eaf",
                                        "entry_id": "228377f6-1d2d-3e8b-80d6-3a6aebfaea89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a higher weight, especially body fat, than what is generally considered healthy for a given body type and height."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b1375eb-8eac-48d4-b9c3-fd05362c3510",
                                                "sense_id": "cd59d8ef-76fb-37ab-8e10-c6f5257f5eaf",
                                                "text": "Before her diet, Jane was noticeably overweight, but she shed five kilos in the next two months."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b386d0bb-ddb9-3018-91f3-d08b6a1b81a0",
                                        "entry_id": "228377f6-1d2d-3e8b-80d6-3a6aebfaea89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Weighing more than what is allowed for safety or legal commerce."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a vehicle"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd151cfb-ee64-4100-a457-47e1bba2ece8",
                                                "sense_id": "b386d0bb-ddb9-3018-91f3-d08b6a1b81a0",
                                                "text": "All States allow oversized vehicles if a special permit is obtained, although most States will grant overweight permits only for non-divisible loads."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e146489a-9378-4e16-87ab-71c28ead2697",
                                                "sense_id": "b386d0bb-ddb9-3018-91f3-d08b6a1b81a0",
                                                "text": "He got as far as the first weigh station, where troopers found his truck to be overweight and threatened to pull him off the road."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57bdf635-2954-42b2-b175-d1591c6ed30a",
                                                "sense_id": "b386d0bb-ddb9-3018-91f3-d08b6a1b81a0",
                                                "text": "The records did not reveal any previous encounters with severe turbulence. The three major alterations/repairs involving the wing were either far outboard of the strut wing station, or were performed on the right wing. Two overweight landings had been recorded since the aircraft was put into service with Evergreen. In both cases, an inspection of the airplane was accomplished in accordance with the Boeing Maintenance Manual."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00bd0faa-5e31-4985-aee8-c9b9462170c9",
                                                "sense_id": "b386d0bb-ddb9-3018-91f3-d08b6a1b81a0",
                                                "text": "Postaccident examination of the vehicle indicated, for example, that the driver had not adequately maintained his logbook and that his vehicle had been overweight for travel in Indiana."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6983b92f-a93c-33c7-8383-f0e628337646",
                                        "entry_id": "228377f6-1d2d-3e8b-80d6-3a6aebfaea89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a portfolio relatively heavily invested in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "followed by a noun or prepositional phrase indicating a security or type of security"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "388d157b-bc0b-47e3-b1ea-b872ea7e8fa5",
                                                "sense_id": "6983b92f-a93c-33c7-8383-f0e628337646",
                                                "text": "Our portfolio is very overweight (in) Asian technology stocks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "overweight",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d24315e5-3317-349c-97d1-9b5fcf02c65d",
                                        "entry_id": "ebf658f9-b7cf-3995-9750-642bf439401b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An excess of weight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9d40cde-073f-4482-a9ca-e3c8da226ab6",
                                                "sense_id": "d24315e5-3317-349c-97d1-9b5fcf02c65d",
                                                "text": "It is clear that a bird would certainly be grounded by overweight if it retained eggs in the body and discharged them in large numbers at one time, like a turtle[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ab93acd-fae8-4370-8633-f8cee27aefa6",
                                                "sense_id": "d24315e5-3317-349c-97d1-9b5fcf02c65d",
                                                "text": "[…] and shall pay not only the amount of the permit fee for overlength, overheight, overwidth or overweight as might be due, but an additional civil penalty of fifty dollars for the first offense, one hundred dollars for the second offense and one hundred fifty dollars for each additional offense; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d4488cf-76bc-3c0c-b9f4-1db06a44fa1e",
                                        "entry_id": "ebf658f9-b7cf-3995-9750-642bf439401b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being overweight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dccc810-918f-4759-b08a-89275507c9ef",
                                                "sense_id": "5d4488cf-76bc-3c0c-b9f4-1db06a44fa1e",
                                                "text": "SCHOOL MEAL ISSUES FOR CHILDREN AT RISK FOR OVERWEIGHT"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "523be444-f7cc-3026-9b6e-387f53b770fd",
                                        "entry_id": "ebf658f9-b7cf-3995-9750-642bf439401b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An overweight person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cda34923-809a-4bb6-ad97-9cfd202edc53",
                                                "sense_id": "523be444-f7cc-3026-9b6e-387f53b770fd",
                                                "text": "The study provides up-to-date facts on the variety of diseases, vascular, metabolic, hepatic, and other, which are responsible for the excess mortality of overweights."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20714030-daf3-4f4f-b2d2-e09a5b1c88d5",
                                                "sense_id": "523be444-f7cc-3026-9b6e-387f53b770fd",
                                                "text": "Singh found that the normal weight figures were judged more attractive than the underweights‚ who were more attractive than the overweights."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0c62897-51da-464e-bd73-0552168cbb61",
                                                "sense_id": "523be444-f7cc-3026-9b6e-387f53b770fd",
                                                "text": "Subjects were grouped as Group 1 and Group 2 according to VAI, and normals, overweights and obeses according to BMI."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54345468-c128-3b7a-9f51-17a354c24346",
                                        "entry_id": "ebf658f9-b7cf-3995-9750-642bf439401b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A security or class of securities in which one has a heavy concentration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec737400-e430-4bb1-9927-585dc0976970",
                                                "sense_id": "54345468-c128-3b7a-9f51-17a354c24346",
                                                "text": "Apple common stock is one of our overweights."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "overweight",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0fb28c77-e5b6-30c2-8d0f-016407fdb152",
                                        "entry_id": "a5ba1f21-676f-331e-a452-d4eaaf510974",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To weigh down: to put too heavy a burden on."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e89c13e7-d599-4e08-9486-a36f5a46b425",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb28c77-e5b6-30c2-8d0f-016407fdb152",
                                                "text": "Such things are not for us to know. Knowledge is to the strong, and we are weak. Too much wisdom would perchance blind our imperfect sight, and too much strength would make us drunk, and over-weight our feeble reason till it fell and we were drowned in the depths of our own vanity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8b33014-0f7f-4d33-a10b-c60376c91fa9",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb28c77-e5b6-30c2-8d0f-016407fdb152",
                                                "text": "By noon the fat, perspiring, and importantly busy merchant arrives, overweighted with red blood, fat, and responsibility, for a game of manille or dominoes with three or four old cronies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49bb7111-82ab-45f3-89c4-5da91e255f1d",
                                                "sense_id": "0fb28c77-e5b6-30c2-8d0f-016407fdb152",
                                                "text": "Throughout the country there were: rupture of telecommunications, resulting amongst other things from telegraph wires and posts overweighted by snow or struck down by gales; [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6338826-de4e-3f36-b503-307c8dea02f4",
                                        "entry_id": "a5ba1f21-676f-331e-a452-d4eaaf510974",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To place excessive weight or emphasis on; to overestimate the importance of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d57e665e-bd49-4e71-aadc-a869625d2083",
                                                "sense_id": "b6338826-de4e-3f36-b503-307c8dea02f4",
                                                "text": "We also over-weight such vaine future conjectures, which infant-spirits give us."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "255fe8de-cee5-4081-a337-bf4543ac8779",
                                                "sense_id": "b6338826-de4e-3f36-b503-307c8dea02f4",
                                                "text": "Kinnel explained it, the problem at Select High Income was that it overweighted mortgage bonds and underweighted other types of corporate debt, a strategy that backfired when the mortgage market collapsed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
